You can create a CSS class to make all h2 headings orange using the following code:

```css
.orange-h2 {
    color: orange;
}
```
You can then apply this class to any h2 element in your HTML by adding a `class="orange-h2"` attribute to the h2 tags. Here's an example:
```html
<h2 class="orange-h2">This is an orange heading</h2>
```
